  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/15/custom-background-hd.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"78\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">简介</span></p>\n<p>专为我的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 整合包制作的自定义主菜单背景资源包。现已作为独立资源包发布。&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">描述</span></p>\n<p>这将进一步提升你的原版游戏体验，允许你将主菜单背景更改为你喜欢的任何内容。&nbsp;</p>\n<p>只需下载此资源包并应用它，即可拥有自定义的主菜单背景。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如何更改背景</p>\n<p>- 从任意来源获取 PNG 截图或高清图片，并将其覆盖到压缩包内的以下文件。<em>Custom Background HD.zip / assets / minecraft / textures / gui / title / background /&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">panorama_overlay.png</span></em></p>\n<p>- 确保你的背景图片已重命名为 'panorama_overlay.png'&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- 应用该资源包，即可享受自定义主菜单背景</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>图片背景来源 -&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fillustrations%252ffire-and-water-hands-fight-fire-2354583%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/illustrations/fire-and-water-hands-fight-fire-2354583/</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/12/2023-11-16_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/13/2023-11-16_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/14/2023-11-16_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即获取服务器，与好友一同畅玩！点击 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a> 或下方横幅，并使用优惠码 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享受 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</